# The Stone Brain: "{2}, {T}, Exile The Stone Brain: Choose a card name. Search target opponent's graveyard, hand, and library for
# up to four cards with that name and exile them. That player shuffles, then draws a card for each card exiled from their hand
# this way." Bot2 holds an Ornithopter in its graveyard (discarded to hand size on turn 2), three in its hand and one in its
# library. Bot1 names Ornithopter, takes the graveyard one, two of the three in the hand (leaving one, as the ruling allows) and
# the library one: four in all. Bot2 draws two cards, one for each card exiled from the hand, not three (the graveyard and library
# cards do not count) and not four. Three sources are tapped for the {2}, so one mana stays in the pool.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
The Stone Brain
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Island
Island
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Stone Brain.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Cleanup]
Bot2.Discard(Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.The Stone Brain.Activate(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana = {B}
Bot1.Name(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter; Ornithopter)
Bot1.Search(Ornithopter)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Ornithopter; Ornithopter; Ornithopter; Ornithopter; The Stone Brain
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Ornithopter
Bot2.Library.Count = 8
Bot1.Battlefield.The Stone Brain = (absent)
